# SmartCOD AI - Environment Configuration

# Server
PROJECT_NAME="SmartCOD AI"
VERSION="1.0.0"
API_PREFIX="/api"
DATABASE_URL="sqlite:///./smartcod.db"

# Financial Constants (Assignment Spec)
